 "termination": "final", "final": "The nightly failure is fixed and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` passed `ROUND_HALF_UP` to `quantize`, while its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding.\n- **Change:** on branch `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. The test values hold under that mode: 2.675 gives 2.68 and 2.665 gives 2.66.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI did not merge it. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner, so that step is still pending.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the test and the implementation side by side.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015iHFU7XCFSRcUpo1FqkJC2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XwHDNpaD1PAb5gZUo8SLrb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: the docstring and FIN-212 call for ROUND_HALF_EVEN, but the code passes ROUND_HALF_UP. I checked the test values against half-even: 2.675 becomes 2.68 (7 is odd, so it rounds up to the even 8), and 2.665 becomes 2.66 (6 is even). Both match. I'll create the branch and make the one-line change.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01N85i7DoyW5MrwCfQhjU2cY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "conte